<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Your company must be a member of the International Pet and Animal Transportation Association (IPATA) or the Animal Transport Association (ATA) and have the ability to; </span></p>

<ul>
	<li class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Have a qualified vet who is a member of the Australian Veterinary Association complete the Brachycephalic Obstructive Airway Syndrome (BOAS) check. </span></li>
	<li class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Lodge and collect the animal at point of departure and arrival </span></li>
	<li class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Have suitable indemnities in place </span></li>
	<li class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Comply with the requirements of the IATA Live Animal Regulations and any other operational handling requirement as advised by Qantas<br />
	Undertake audits of operations by Qantas or Qantas’ representative as necessary. </span></li>
</ul>

<div class="MsoListParagraph" style="margin-left:0cm;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1">&nbsp;</div>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Please complete the attachment and forward the completed and signed agreement to </span><a href="mailto:specialmoves@qantas.com.au"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;
font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">specialmoves@qantas.com.au</span></a><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"> </span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp; </span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Aptos,sans-serif">Kind Regards,</span></span><br />
